            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"table-1-customers-pk-customer_id\">Table 1 \u2014 <code>customers</code>  [PK: customer_id]</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>total_orders</code> is assigned here (repeat buyers get 2). <code>first_order_date</code> is left blank now and\nfilled in from the actual orders once they exist.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
