        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"tables-2-3-orders-and-order_items\">Tables 2 &amp; 3 \u2014 <code>orders</code> and <code>order_items</code></h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each order expands from a customer's <code>total_orders</code>. Line items drive <code>order_total</code> (= sum of\n<code>line_total</code>) and <code>item_count</code>. Every order also creates its <strong>converting session</strong> so the\nfunnel stays consistent.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Kclp",
      "code_hash": "867728f28f017cdf947b57c17d291803",
