            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"table-6-events-pk-event_id\">Table 6 \u2014 <code>events</code>  [PK: event_id]</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Funnel detail per session. Every session gets a <code>page_view</code> + some <code>product_view</code>s; sessions\nthat reached the cart add <code>add_to_cart</code> \u2192 <code>checkout_start</code>, and converters end with <code>purchase</code>.</span></span>"
